  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fr&#xe4;mja Georgiens gr&#xf6;na och inkluderande utveckling - ISET PI</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Georgia&apos;s Green and Inclusive Development - ISET PI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det strategiska m&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;det &#xe4;r att fr&#xe4;mja Georgiens gr&#xf6;na och inkluderande utveckling genom att st&#xf6;dja evidensbaserat beslutsfattande och kapacitetsuppbyggnad hos politiska parter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Objective of the core support grant is Promoting Georgia&#x2019;s Green and Inclusive Development Through Supporting Evidence-Based Policy Making and Capacity Building of Policy Parties.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">There are five objectives for achieving the stated overarching strategic objective: 1) Maximizing ISET-PIs contribution and impact on evidence-based policy making, including green and inclusive growth, and the EU; 2) Developing the capacity of key policy parties  the national government, parliament,
and local government  for the design and implementation of policies, and civil society and businesses for effective participation in policy formulation and debate, with a focus on the green and inclusive growth agenda and EU harmonization; 3) Contributing to public outreach and dialogue on the green and inclusive growth agenda and other priority areas; 4) Broadening and deepening regional cooperation on global and regional challenges in the Eastern Partnership and beyond. 5) Building the institutional resilience and sustainability of ISET-PI as a prime economic think tank through effectively managing institutional risks.</narrative>
  </description>
